{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/95yrjevk8v",
  "title": "GSC 提示 HTTP 会跳转到 HTTPS 不要慌",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "GSC",
    "群聊精华归档"
  ],
  "content": "<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>大佬们,问个问题呀, 我 dns 用的 cloudflare  服务器用vercel , 现在发现 vercel 会强制将 http 转成 https, 谁知道怎么设置不让强制转 https 呀? 查了下资料 ,vercel 貌似不能设置,有其他方法么</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>我先问个问题，为什么你要用 http</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>另外，这里的跳转是 cf 做的，不是 vercel 做的</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>我看 gsc 有些爬虫请求提示错误了,说有 301 跳转,我看了下是 http转 https 了.   我再 cf 上配置的转发道 vercel 的域名, 我看vercel 的域名是强制给我做了 https 转发.     cf 如果关闭 https就会导致 308 错误访问不了了</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>你的问题是什么？</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>我想解决 gsc 提示的这个错误, 让我的请求不光支持 https 还支持 http,  访问 http 的时候不要强制转成 https, 但是现在配置不出来这种效果</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>你的想法是错误的</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>正确的做法就是应该要实现 http 跳转到 https</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>你之前的设置是正确的</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>不用管 gsc 报的这个错误么<span title=\"[捂脸]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>很奇怪的是 gsc 会爬 http 协议的 url</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>而 GSC 检测到了这种情况，然后提示你了。\n这不叫做报错。</div>\n<div>你本来想实现 HTTP 跳转到 HTTPS ，然后 GSC 检测之后告诉你，的确是从 HTTP 跳转到了 HTTPS ，这是符合你预期的事情，GSC 帮你检查了，是正确的设置，这不叫报错。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>不要把 GSC 的提示都当做报错。\n只有上面提示的，跟你本来想要实现的不一样，才是报错，</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>举例，某个页面本来应该正常的，结果 GSC 提示你404了，这时候你就要去看为什么会404，然后试图去修复。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>而如果某个页面就是你想删除的，删除之后404是在你预期内的，那么 GSC 提示你404，这就是正常情况了，不用处理</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>懂了吗？GSC 只是提示，不包含对错判断。\n具体要你自己去判断是否偏离预期。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>好的<span title=\"[呲牙]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span>  先不管这个错误了</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>请换一个说法，这不叫做错误</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>左十八:好的<span title=\"[呲牙]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span>  先不管这个错误了</div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>不然你就会一直把 GSC 的提示当错误</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>你应该说，不管这个提示了</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>这是思维观念的改变</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>左十八</strong></div>\n<div>嗯嗯</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>怪才</strong></div>\n<div>@哥飞 飞哥，你太适合当老师了<span title=\"[强]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span>，啥都讲得到了位</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/95yrjevk8v_img4.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>凡人</strong></div>\n<div>我以前也碰到下，提示http转https,还把插件的代码一个个去改，然而发现gsc里面还有。\n后面也是群里说的没关系，就安心了。<span title=\"/::D\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span></div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>左十八:很奇怪的是 gsc 会爬 http 协议的 url</div>\n</blockquote>",
